<title>FRANCE: Homeless woman dies of cold in France.</title>
<headline>Homeless woman dies of cold in France.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 53-year-old homeless woman died of cold on Christmas Day as below-freezing temperatures swept through northern France, police said.</p>
<p>The woman was found dead in a disused railway depot in the Channel port of Le Treport. Two male companions suffering from hypothermia were taken to hospital.</p>
